<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>AACS - Comprovante de Doação</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { background-color: #f8f9fa; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; }
        .touch-target { min-height: 52px; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; }
        .card-custom { border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #dee2e6; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav class="navbar navbar-dark bg-primary px-3 mb-4">
        <div class="container-fluid max-width-md">
            <a href="/" class="navbar-brand fw-bold fs-5 text-white text-decoration-none">
                🛡️ AACS — Gestão de Doações
            </a>
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                <a href="/" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-sm">← Início</a>
                <a href="/logout" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-sm">Sair 🚪</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="container mb-5" style="max-width: 500px;">
        <div class="card card-custom p-4 bg-white text-center">
            <div class="mb-3">
                <span class="display-1 text-success">🎉</span>
            </div>
            <h1 class="h4 fw-bold text-dark mb-2">Atendimento Concluído!</h1>
            <p class="text-secondary small mb-4">Cesta básica entregue e baixa registrada no estoque PEPS com sucesso.</p>

            <div class="bg-light p-3 rounded text-start mb-4 border">
                <h2 class="h6 fw-bold text-dark border-bottom pb-2 mb-2">📄 Recibo Digital do Atendimento</h2>
                <p class="mb-1 text-dark small"><strong>Beneficiário:</strong> {{ assistido.nome if assistido else 'Maria Oliveira da Silva' }}</p>
                <p class="mb-1 text-dark small"><strong>CPF (LGPD):</strong> {{ assistido.cpf_formatado if assistido else '***.456.789-**' }}</p>
                <p class="mb-1 text-dark small"><strong>Data/Hora:</strong> {{ assistido.data_ultimo_recebimento if assistido else 'Agora' }}</p>
                <p class="mb-0 text-dark small"><strong>Status de Liberação:</strong> <span class="badge bg-success">Registrado</span></p>
            </div>

            <div class="d-grid gap-2">
                <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary touch-target d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center">
                    🔍 Novo Atendimento
                </a>
                <a href="/estoque" class="btn btn-outline-secondary touch-target d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center">
                    📦 Ir para o Painel do Estoque (PEPS)
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

</body>
</html>
